# Build context allowlist (issue #16 P1b). Only what the images need is sent to
# the builder. The git-ignored .smoke/ holds real owner-audience payloads and
# must never reach an image or a build log (invariant 11).
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/
!packages/
!registry/
# The migrations only (P2a: the migrate role); never db/schema.sql or anything else.
!db/migrations/
!scripts/install-pnpm.sh
!deploy/web/Caddyfile
!deploy/web/site.caddy

# Never, even inside an allowed directory.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-e2e
**/e2e
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test
**/fixtures
**/.smoke
**/.env*
apps/web/src/paraglide
